announcements/1835236783565059","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4592040-1832065502815777","game_id":"steam-4592040","kind":"update","title":"Demo Shop Update","summary":"*screenshot of new shop area, with the MimicBig Update! There's a whole new area as well!New Features/Changes:Fixed a ton of bugsCamera system, click D+R to enter camera mode. Use middle mouse button to follow a piece, arrow keys to switch between them & the O-key to look with your mouse. Still a work in progress.Food eating animationMore piece emote reactions, find out which ones by playing the game.Menu visual updateNew promotion visualsItem range now visualisedDifferent cursors based on what ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-08T16:52:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502815777","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4592040-1830797770246428","game_id":"steam-4592040","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Release!","summary":"First VersionThe first version of the demo is now available & playable. We'll keep working on this while making the full game, so if you have any bugs you run into report them (there's a button in the pause screen).30+ Buffs, 5 Pieces & 3 EnvironmentsThat's the amount of content we're launching the demo with, enough for hours of gameplay.Next Demo Update PlannedNot yet, but in the future we'll add another major update to the demo. So stay tuned!Game DurationPeople usually take over 1 hour to com","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-28T21:00:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770246428","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"s